      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does car transport from Guwahati to Delhi typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 1,912 km via NH 19 usually requires 3‑4 business days under normal traffic conditions. Our dedicated hydraulic‑ramp carriers operate round‑the‑clock, and we factor in scheduled fuel stops and mandatory driver rest periods to ensure timely, safe delivery without compromising on vehicle protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does Shree Ashirwad use to prevent scratches during the Guwahati‑Delhi move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a four‑step safety protocol: a joint pre‑loading inspection, hydraulic ramp loading with anti‑scratch pads, a 4‑wheel lock system that immobilises the chassis, and edge‑padding using high‑density foam and custom wooden crates for fragile parts. This zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by IRDAI‑approved insurance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any extra fees for transporting a car with a trailer or heavy load on the Guwahati‑Delhi route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, a supplementary surcharge may apply for oversized or heavy‑load vehicles, typically calculated per kilogram above the standard limit. The charge covers additional fuel consumption, reinforced tie‑down equipment, and specialized carrier allocation. All extra fees are disclosed upfront in the detailed quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are required for RTO registration when moving a car from Guwahati to Delhi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original Registration Certificate (RC), a valid insurance policy, a signed consent letter from the owner, a copy of the e‑Way bill, and a photo ID proof. Our team assists in preparing the paperwork and ensures compliance with both Assam and Delhi transport authorities.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is insurance coverage structured for a vehicle shipped on the Guwahati‑Delhi route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value coverage under an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy. The insurance covers accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards throughout the journey. A detailed policy document is shared before loading, and any claim is processed swiftly with full transparency.</p>
